      <p style="margin-top: 2rem;">The NLV does not require you to sell your US property or close your US accounts. Many Florida applicants maintain their US homes while living in Spain on the visa — it simply requires spending less than 183 days per year in the US to avoid complications with Spanish tax residency (a topic to discuss with a tax adviser before moving).</p>
