            <li>FRS / federal / military pension letter</li>
            <li>401(k) / IRA distribution statements</li>
            <li>Most recent Form 1040</li>
            <li>Brokerage / investment statements</li>
            <li>Certified Spanish translations of key financial documents</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
